      <title>Bessent 回应 Druckenmiller 债券干预批评 中美利差压力传导至人民币</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260831/Bessent-%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94-Druckenmiller-%E5%80%BA%E5%88%B8%E5%B9%B2%E9%A2%84%E6%89%B9%E8%AF%84-%E4%B8%AD%E7%BE%8E%E5%88%A9%E5%B7%AE%E5%8E%8B%E5%8A%9B%E4%BC%A0%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B3%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%B8%81/</link>
